\viewkind4\uc1\pard\tx3780\tx3960\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Lord, her watch Thy Church is keeping ;
\par When shall earth Thy rule obey ?
\par When shall end the night of weeping? 
\par When shall break the promised day ?
\par See the whitening harvest languish,
\par Waiting still the labourers' toil ;
\par Was it vain, Thy Son 's deep anguish ?
\par Shall the strong retain the spoil?
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Tidings, sent to every creature,
\par Millions yet have never heard;
\par Can they hear without a preacher?
\par Lord Almighty, give the word:
\par Give the word; in every nation
\par Let the gospel trumpet sound,
\par Witnessing a world's salvation
\par To the earth's remotest bound.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Then the end : Thy Church completed,
\par All Thy chosen gathered in,
\par With their King in glory seated,
\par Satan bound, and banished sin ;
\par Gone for ever parting, weeping,
\par Hunger, sorrow, death, and pain:
\par Lo! Her watch Thy church is keeping ;
\par Come, Lord Jesus, come to reign !
\par                                           Amen.
\par \pard\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2 
\par }

